--[[
        THE WASHROOM -- a custom room for DOORS' Hotel- (the Hotel before Hotel+)

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/Washroom"))()

        Run it in a room of the Hotel-: you are taken to a landing in the Hotel's own style (its wallpaper, its wood,
        its trim, its lamp: the colours and textures of its rooms) and a staircase goes down from it to the Washroom:
        a big, gloomy, double-height room of chipped white tiles gone yellow, mould in the corners, a wet, shining floor
        with water standing on it. In the middle two long rows of metal washing machines back to back; big industrial
        dryers along the walls; neon tubes hanging from the ceiling, flickering, buzzing; linen carts with stained
        sheets, heaps of clothes, spilled detergent; big pipes under the ceiling dripping on the floor.

        Hiding: the open dryers (along the walls and in the middle rows). "Hide": a heavy metal clank and you see
        only the perforated grille of its door. As with Hide in DOORS, do not stay in too long: after a while it gets to
        you (DOORS' own Hide effect), and then it throws you out (40 damage).

        The way on is the watertight door at the far end, its light red: it is held by the water. Find the drain
        valve on one of the main pipes (one of three, a different one every time), turn it: the water gurgles down the
        drains, the light turns green, the door opens (its wheel turning) onto the stairs back up to the Hotel, in front
        of the door of the room you came from.

        Rush or Ambush come through once while you are there (and at once if DOORS sends one): first every empty drum
        starts spinning by itself, the lights flicker; then it races through. Not in a dryer: DOORS' own jumpscare, your
        death. Ambush comes back, two to four times.

        Dupe: one of the dryers is wrong (water boiling inside, drops on its glass, steam): hide in it and it attacks
        (40 damage). And a second watertight door, on the left wall, is not a door at all: its light never turns green.

        Every now and then a dryer starts with a loud metal bang. In some drums and carts: gold, a flashlight (F turns it
        on), the emergency key (it opens the watertight door without draining). Your steps splash: DOORS' own water
        footsteps on its floor.

        Only you see it and walk in it (the server does not know it is there). The gold is only on your screen.
        Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). getgenv().__Washroom() takes it away.
]]

